{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00501","headline":"郊庙歌辞 祀九宫贵神乐章 豫和 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 祀九宫贵神乐章 豫和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"享申百礼，庆洽百灵。\n上排阊阖，洞入杳冥。\n奠玉高坛，燔柴广庭。\n神之降福，万国咸宁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00501.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00501","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}